        "raw": "<p>This thread is reserved for me to post the scenarios and story parts for the Sentinels of the Multiverse Living Campaign #4.&nbsp;</p><p>This chapter will run slightly long because I&#39;m later than intended getting it posted. Generally, I will post new chapters on Monday, probably early afternoon Central (Chicago/St. Louis) time. Games can be submitted up until early morning on Mondays, when I&#39;ll be working out how the results of the scenario affect the ongoing story.</p><p>Early stages of the Campaign will have everything up through Vengeance as fair game. As I start to get clues that WCos packages are arriving at some of the EU destinations, WCos material will become fair game to use.</p><p>Any questions? Post them back in the &quot;Gauging Interest&quot; thread in this same forum.&nbsp;</p><p>Ready to go? Let&#39;s rock. (Rhyolite, if you please.)</p><p>Edit: Pydro has graciously created <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/190YTGdQ9SaIIS53Hnb_vTC2rJA0hLsqV-2UxrM6wWwQ/viewform\">this form</a> to submit results. However, I&#39;ll still start a separate thread so people can describe their battles &amp; tell me anything interesting. :)</p>",
